WEBVTT

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:30.837
can be used even by someone
who believes that view of the world,

00:07:30.861 --> 00:07:33.630
that there is a stance
that someone can take

00:07:33.654 --> 00:07:39.135
to be open to creative spark.

00:07:39.159 --> 00:07:42.094
Or does the magic not work

00:07:42.118 --> 00:07:45.237
unless you actually believe
that worldview that you just outlined?

00:07:45.261 --> 00:07:47.986
EG: No, I'm not
a fundamentalist about this.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:50.075
I'm not an evangelical.

00:07:50.099 --> 00:07:55.680
If my offering to you and these ideas
can be useful to you as metaphor,

00:07:55.704 --> 00:07:58.183
then by all means, use it as metaphor.

00:07:58.207 --> 00:08:00.727
It was very funny, because
when "Big Magic" came out,